<title>USA: TABLE-Northern Trust Corp Q2 net rises.</title>
<headline>TABLE-Northern Trust Corp Q2 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-07-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Shr primary		$0.65		    $0.54</p>
<p> Shr diluted		$0.65		    $0.54</p>
<p> Net			 75,400		   63,400</p>
<p> Net int. income	109,200		   95,500</p>
<p> Nonint. income	 223,200		  195,700</p>
<p> Loan loss prov	     500		    4,000</p>
<p> Retun on equity	  20.01		    18.47</p>
<p> Avg shrs primary     114,484		  114,889</p>
<p> Avg shrs diluted     114,790		  115,171</p>
<p>	  6  MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr primary		$1.26		    $1.07</p>
<p> Shr diluted		$1.26		    $1.06</p>
<p> Net			147,100		  124,900</p>
<p> Net int. income	215,300		  188,900</p>
<p> Nonint. income	 432,500		  383,900</p>
<p> Loan loss prov	   1,000		    9,000</p>
