<p> Avg shrs primary     114,567		  114,936</p>
<p> Avg shrs diluted     114,838		  115,610</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers. Return in equity is in percent.)</p>
<p>NOTE: Assets at June 30 were $26.05 billion, compared to $21.75 billion a year ago.</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787))</p>
